  "concise_summary": "PKD develops a unified theory synthesizing evolutionary cognition (via Teilhard de Chardin), Freudian abreaction therapy, and early Christian pneumatology. He argues that his 2-3-74 visions represent a spontaneous access to paranormal shrewdness—an acausal parallel intuition to hidden reality—which he now reinterprets as phylogenic abreaction: reliving trauma from AD 70 Rome as an early Christian (Thomas) trapped in a modern security trap (the Xerox missive), fusing two spacetime continua and enabling the Paraclete/Holy Spirit to enter the present world through him.",
  "key_claims": [
    "My 2-3-74 experience was an evolutionary quantum leap in perception and cognition, not merely psychological but biologically and physiologically real.",
    "Paranormal shrewdness is an acausal parallel Gestalt: knowing without deduction, a facility that matches hidden reality's form without causal derivation.",
    "VALIS is St. Sophia, a macro-organism of divine intelligence that operates through instinct across species, accessible as a vast mind not my own.",
    "2-3-74 triggered phylogenic abreaction: I relived my original trauma as an early Christian in AD 70 Rome (identity as Thomas), which fused with my present anxiety about capture.",
    "This abreaction exorcised my chronic neurotic fear of being hunted, proving Freud's theory of buried traumatic memory, but the trauma was 2000 years old.",
    "The Holy Spirit rode the phylogenic self from the ancient world to the modern as a time-tube conduit, bringing Christ through me a second time—a theophany that transcends both AI voice and the Xerox missive trap."
  ],
